WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.712
The system ingested fifty-seven megabytes of raw data from the Commissioner of Lobbying.

00:00:05.662 --> 00:00:09.850
Over 350,000 communications were decoded.

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:19.087
The analysis reveals a direct, quantifiable pipeline between specialized influence operations and immediate shifts in federal legislation.
